   "texto": "Part two. My hand was on the latch, and the woman outside was begging.",
   "pausa": 0.8,
   "vel": 0.88
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then my phone buzzed. One bar of signal, for the first time in six hours.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "It was an emergency broadcast. Every word in capital letters.",
   "pausa": 0.9,
   "vel": 0.85
  },
  {
   "texto": "If you are inside a stopped elevator, you are alive because of it.",
   "pausa": 0.8,
   "vel": 0.84
  },
  {
   "texto": "Sealed boxes were never breached. You are the only ones we can still reach.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "Do not open the door. Not for anyone. Not even for a voice you know.",
   "pausa": 1.0,
   "vel": 0.82
  },
  {
